questions.example:
`@property
 def radius(self): return self._radius
@radius.setter
def radius(self, value):
    if value < 0: raise ValueError("radius must be non-negative")
    self._radius = value` keeps `circle.radius = 5` working while rejecting `circle.radius = -1`.

